tatement I inaccurate.</p>\n<p>Statement II is accurate. When sucrose undergoes hydrolysis, it results in the formation of invert sugar, a mixture of glucose and fructose. This change involves the inversion of optical rotation, which is where the term \"invert sugar\" comes from.</p>"},"hi":{"direction":null,"comprehension":null,"content":"<p>\u0928\u0940\u091a\u0947 \u0926\u094b \u0915\u0925\u0928 \u0926\u093f\u090f \u0917\u090f \u0939\u0948\u0902:</p>\n<p>\u0915\u0925\u0928 I: D-(+)- \u0917\u094d\u0932\u0942\u0915\u094b\u0938 + D-(+) \u092b\u094d\u0930\u0915\u094d\u091f\u094b\u0938 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.72ex\" height=\"2.58ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1140.3 2528.3 1140.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"REL\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"undefined\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mover\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-SO-2192\" transform=\"translate(1638.3,0)\"></use><svg width=\"1708.3\" height=\"180\" x=\"0\" y=\"160\" viewBox=\"427.1 160 1708.3 180\"><use data-c=\"2190\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-SO-2190\" transform=\"scale(4.201,1)\"></use></svg></g><g data-mml-node=\"mpadded\" transform=\"translate(0,683.2) scale(0.707)\"><g transform=\"translate(278,-200)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(783,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXA